OL,3,GNEWSATown baffled by Christmas car     
OL,4,Awrapping 'bandits'                     
OL,6,FA town has been left baffled after     
OL,7,Fmultiple cars were covered in Christmas
OL,8,Fwrapping paper.                        
OL,10,FResidents in Redditch, Worcestershire, 
OL,11,Fhave dubbed the jokers responsible the 
OL,12,F"wrapping bandits", with no one having 
OL,13,Fany idea what their motivations are.   
OL,15,FDespite the mystery around it, local   
OL,16,Fresident Natalie Mellors said the      
OL,17,Ffestive prank had brought a lot of joy 
OL,18,Fto people in the area.                 
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
