OL,3,GNEWSATown baffled by Christmas car     
OL,4,Awrapping 'bandits'                     
OL,6,FMellors spotted one of the "Christmas  
OL,7,Fpresent" cars on Plymouth Road with her
OL,8,Ffiance Andrew Lloyd and said: "It was  
OL,9,Ftotally covered in wrapping paper with 
OL,10,Fjust the aerial sticking out."         
